]</source><year>1984</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>1027</fpage><lpage>1029</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6543409</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hendriks</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Geerts</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Malingre</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The occurrence of valeranone and crypto-fauronol in the essential oil of <italic>Valeriana officinalis L. s. l</italic>. collected in the northern part of The Netherlands</article-title><source>Pharmac Wekblad Scient Edition</source><year>1981</year><volume>116</volume><fpage>1316</fpage><lpage>1320</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF02193381</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>